	(text "USB-C on the SuperMini powers everything: its 5V pin feeds the DAC and the amp, its 3.3 V\nregulator feeds the IMU, joystick, top board (OLED, mic), Qwiic and the breakouts."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 238.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d0cace8c-8f58-5904-ad63-2ebd1e7361b4")
	)
	(text "JP1-JP4 stand in for the H1L-H4L bridges on the back of the DAC board, out of reach once it is\nmounted. Leave them OPEN if those are set; otherwise FLT=L, DEMP=L, XSMT=H (unmute), FMT=L.\nH is DAC_3V3, the module's own 3.3 V regulator, never the board 3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 245.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4e032538-24b9-5dcf-97ca-ff5584045dbf")
	)
	(text "The joystick's \"+5V\" pin goes to 3V3: the ESP32 ADC reads 0-3.3 V. The IMU's +X axis points at\nthe nose (the USB / jack edge). AD0 to GND: address 0x68."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 255.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "02c5c696-2b24-5fef-8ff7-ca7e0cc139d2")
	)
	(text "EXP A / EXP B carry every GPIO the design leaves free, including the SuperMini's underside pads\n(reached with pogo pins). 45 and 46 are strapping pins; 48 drives the module's RGB LED."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 262.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8359c70e-4a4f-5150-850d-1a4a66d0f3fe")
	)
	(text "R1, R2 are not fitted: the OLED and GY-521 boards carry I2C pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 269.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f3d7670-b66e-5382-80b3-96241c89c278")
	)
